chain: IS1009
language: en
note: REAL meetings: AMI Meeting Corpus (CC BY 4.0) scenario series IS1009a-d, a role-played design team speaking spontaneously. Turns = AMI manual words merged per speaker (gap <= 2 s), turns under 2 words dropped. Gold = decisions listed in the human DECISIONS abstracts, evidence found through the human summary links; the slot list and allowed values were written by the AI assistant. Meeting dates are assigned (weekly) because AMI has none. Not the product's target domain (corporate board meetings).
now: 2026-03-02T00:00:00Z
people: id=Industrial Designer, me=Marketing Expert, pm=Project Manager, ui=User Interface Designer
object: price | decision | Selling price (euro) | amount:number
object: teletext | decision | Teletext feature | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: power | decision | Power source | outcome:enum[batteries,kinetic,solar]
object: case_material | decision | Case material | outcome:enum[plastic,rubber,wood]
object: button_material | decision | Button material | outcome:enum[soft rubber,hard plastic]
object: shape | decision | Remote shape | outcome:enum[snail shape,standard shape]
object: led_colour | decision | LED colour | outcome:enum[fluorescent green,red,blue]

